# Identity Management

**Authors:** Waleed Alrodhan

## Abstract
<jats:p>In this chapter we provide overviews of the notion of identity and of identity management in Sections 1 and 2, respectively. In section 3 we describe a conceptual identity management model as well as a number of practical models. We also cover a number of related topics including Single Sign-On, Level of Assurance, identity source discovery, security policies, proof-of-rightful-possession, and the use of pseudonyms and temporary IDs. Section 4 concludes the chapter.</jats:p>

**Source:** https://doi.org/10.4018/978-1-61350-498-7.ch017

